sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant ProtectedController
    participant JwtMiddleware

    Client->>ProtectedController: GET /api/profile + Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
    JwtMiddleware->>JwtMiddleware: Validate token signature
    JwtMiddleware->>JwtMiddleware: Check expiration
    JwtMiddleware->>JwtMiddleware: Extract claims
    JwtMiddleware-->>ProtectedController: User context with claims
    ProtectedController-->>Client: User profile data